s later down the line at worst. But at least I\nadd the crash reporter annotation message, if we then crash later down\nthe line...\n\nTested manually by removing select.css from my objdir and using the\nnon-nightly codepath.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313486\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314216\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp", "dom/base/ShadowRoot.cpp", "layout/style/GlobalStyleSheetCache.cpp", "layout/style/GlobalStyleSheetCache.h"], "git_node": "7d361d2e4116ba54e6da60b8fedd255ce547abc6", "git_parents": ["8ea78b41ce06895bc21dbfaef6936884fec9e527"], "node": "32c4d1fb04e261426b8d49b16f2ff81a0072dd03", "parents": ["f89af978e01707c55a5e8b82bec7fb4d11f17486"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785025731, "git_changesets": ["7d361d2e4116ba54e6da60b8fedd255ce547abc6"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "27617": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-beta repo-update HSTS HPKP -  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314185\n", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": "a47c781ab7c2dbaddd3cf4e48a32a5e344956794", "git_parents": ["7d361d2e4116ba54e6da60b8fedd255ce547abc6"], "node": "2e57ddef7c82ec6f252854d11109c40c7ddeb751", "parents": ["32c4d1fb04e261426b8d49b16f2ff81a0072dd03"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785026002, "git_changesets": ["a47c781ab7c2dbaddd3cf4e48a32a5e344956794"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "27618": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054424 - Do not BinarySniff compressed streams we could not decode  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313164\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314202\n", "files": ["netwerk/streamconv/converters/nsUnknownDecoder.cpp"], "git_node": "e