WORK permission after local-network load errors.  a=diannaS\n\nWire ERROR_LOCAL_NETWORK_ACCESS_DENIED through GV and AC so GeckoEngineSession can trigger an app permission request when local-network access is blocked on Android 17+.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316539\n\n(cherry picked from commit 3b05980dd7e744642a3ac184265227878837a26c)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316790\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/engine-gecko/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/engine/gecko/GeckoEngineSession.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/engine-gecko/src/test/java/mozilla/components/browser/engine/gecko/GeckoEngineSessionTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/java/mozilla/components/browser/errorpages/ErrorPages.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/test/java/mozilla/components/browser/errorpages/ErrorPagesTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/AppRequestInterceptor.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/AppRequestInterceptor.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/fragment/BrowserFragment.kt", "mobile/android/geckoview/api.txt", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/GeckoSession.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/WebRequestError.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/doc-files/CHANGELOG.md", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/package-info.java", "mobile/android/geckoview_example/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview_example/GeckoViewActivity.java"], "git_node": "5f02af3cd88ec891e795e3a7f5660c0a6e6e1df6", "git_parents": ["96fb42a8b42395faf207f13f79aa55f195264062"], "node": "4484b64b9197b9de77a32f9d60213ea0278d122c", "parents": ["6b3afd83b2043750129b4b61a30a086eb9c6ec1d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786044217, "git_changesets": ["5f02af3cd88ec891e795e3a7f5660c0a6e6e1df6"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "27877": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-beta repo-update remote-settings mobile-experiments ct-logs -  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316917\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/raw/initial_experiments.json", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/ai-window-prompts.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": "b05ca703eefe14fd6777f18e6e6395f76e536f8b", "git_parents": ["5f02af3cd88ec891e795e3a7f5660c0a6e6e1df6"], "node": "0e7404e49153fc2e949f66835fbf863eb6b74073", "parents": ["4484b64b9197b9de77a32f9d60213ea0278d122c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786047727, "git_changesets": ["b05ca703eefe14fd6777f18e6e6395f76e536f8b"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "27878": {"changesets": [{"author": "Julien Pages \u003cjpages@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056781 - wasm: Refactor interaction between debugger and continuations.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314770\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316926\n", "files": ["js/src/debugger/Debugger.cpp", "js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/js-promise-integration/debug-stale-cont-env.js", "js/src/vm/EnvironmentObject.cpp", "js/src/vm/EnvironmentObject.h"], "git_node": "f6d127dd60510694d187fc6ffd6587dc49cd6d2e", "git_parents": ["b05ca703eefe14fd6777f18e6e6395f76e536f8b"], "node": "eadfd2741777c1814a5e9395aef6bc855d09622b", "parents": ["0e7404e49153fc2e949f66835fbf863eb6b74073"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786049239, "git_changesets": ["f6d127dd60510694d187fc6ffd6587dc49cd6d2e"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "27879": {"changesets": [{"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051788: Clamp content-initiated window resizes to the screen in the parent process.  a=diannaS\n\nBrowserParent::RecvSetDimensions() rescaled a resize request coming from content for DPI and passed it on without bounding the size, and nothing further down keeps a window near the size of its screen. The size passed to window.open() is already bounded that way in nsWindowWatcher::SizeOpenedWindow().\n\nThe size is now clamped to twice the available area of the screen the window is on. Twice rather than exactly the screen, because the size we get for a screen is not always accurate, on Wayland in particular, and all we need is to keep the size in a range the window can be given. The clamp lives in RecvSetDimensions() rather than in nsGlobalWindowOuter, because for a content window the resize is requested in the content process but carried out in the parent, so this is where it can be enforced.\n\nResizeByOuter() also added the deltas coming from content to the current size in 32-bit arithmetic, which overflows for large values. It now adds in 64 bits and keeps the result in range.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316180\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316941\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/test/popups/browser.toml", "browser/base/content/test/popups/browser_popup_resize_clamp.js", "dom/base/nsGlobalWindowOuter.cpp", "dom/ipc/BrowserParent.cpp"], "git_node": "ed48764e851aaa07a44d77acff9846e91a842359", "git_parents": ["f6d127dd60510694d187fc6ffd6587dc49cd6d2e"], "node": "77dc0a034dcdaf4012bae1ef57887f9575c84c80", "parents": ["eadfd2741777c1814a5e9395aef6bc855d09622b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786059160, "git_changesets": ["ed48764e851aaa07a44d77acff9846e91a842359"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "27880": {"changesets": [{"author": "Kershaw Chang \u003ckershaw@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054662 - Add ownership check when registering a WebSocket event listener  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312269\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316983\n", "files": ["netwerk/ipc/NeckoParent.cpp", "netwerk/ipc/NeckoParent.h"], "git_node": "0d003d2041ee81c159cf0b4d4c92b28623f5dc58", "git_parents": ["ed48764e851aaa07a44d77acff9846e91a842359"], "node": "7eb11d9dc7a4cad039215f81a9e42cd1c3e9e1b9", "parents": ["77dc0a034dcdaf4012bae1ef57887f9575c84c80"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786067889, "git_changesets": ["0d003d2041ee81c159cf0b4d4c92b28623f5dc58"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "27881": {"changesets": [{"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from main\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-zh-rCN/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-bg/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-bqi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-cak/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-cy/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-de/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-en-rGB/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-es-rAR/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-fr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-fy-rNL/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-gl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hsb/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ia/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-it/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ja/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-kk/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ko/strings.xml